   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-08-23",
   "text": "Preventing Presidential Election Interference Act\n This bill expands the prohibition on engaging in election interference and increases criminal penalties for violations. In particular, the bill prohibits the President and Vice President from using their authority to interfere with or affect an election."
